---

This repository redistributes no third-party code. It redistributes third-party
fonts: the typefaces of themes/brands/fonts/catalogue/ (Inter, Roboto, Playfair
Display and the others listed in catalogue.json), each under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1, whose text sits in each face's folder (LICENSE). They were taken
unmodified from the @fontsource npm packages named in catalogue.json, each file
with its sha256; tools/fontcatalogue.mjs fetches them again.

Two deliberate absences:

* Yjs and @hocuspocus/provider (MIT) are the room — the shared edit page of the
  hosted service. They are bundled only into that page, which is built by the
  service, not by this repository (`edit: true` in tools/build.mjs). Neither the
  bundle nor the bridge ships here.

* The Garet type family (Type Forward, typeforward.com) is not committed in any
  form. The two free weights are packed into a data-URI stylesheet by
  tools/fontpack.py, on the machine that has them; the licensed variable family
  stays at Jamespot. The default brand here needs no font but the system's.
